    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "This sofa combines soft, cosy comfort with a modern design and neat armrests that evoke a sense of elegant lightness.",
        "You can lean back into the high backrest, relax and enjoy the embracing comfort.",
        "The back cushions let you sink in softly while providing comfortable support for your lower back.",
        "The seat cushion is made with foam and zigzag springs that provide supportive comfort when sitting down.",
        "You can place the chaise longue on the left or right side of the sofa, have one on each side – or two on the same side.",
        "The brown wooden legs add a natural and warm expression to the sofa.",
        "The high legs create an airy look and make it easier to clean the floor under the sofa.",
        "This cover is made of dope-dyed Gunnared fabric in polyester. It is a durable fabric with a wool-like feel, a warm look and a two-toned mélange effect.",
        "The cover is easy to keep clean since it can be machine washed and is easy to take off and put on again.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
